 "notes": "Area names: rows printed with ditto marks (Kathua ,, / Udhampur ,, / Reasi ,, / Mirpur ,, under 'Jammu District'; Chenani ,, under 'Poonch Jagir'; Gilgit ,, under 'Ladakh District') expanded to '<name> District'/'Chenani Jagir'/'Gilgit District'. Printed row numbers (I., 1., ...) dropped. No printed column numbers, so cols = null. Nil cells printed '....' omitted. Bhotia marked 'concluded' (Brukshas, Kashgari, Khapli); these complete the Bhotia (Total) column on leaf 230. PRINT INCONSISTENCY: Chitrali, Frontier Districts, Females printed 3,232 (clearly legible under zoom), but Persons-Males = 6,903-3,621 = 3,282 and Gilgit 24 + Frontier Ilaqas 3,258 = 3,282; State females 3,289 = 7 + 3,282. Kept as printed (3,232); correct value evidently 3,282."
